   "summary": "Early briefings to the council noted ongoing work on tree protection ordinances by the Energy and Environment Committee. Staff presented three proposed ordinances addressing public and private property trees, and the council designated urban tree canopy expansion as a primary annual focus area. The City Council Committee of the Whole subsequently took up formal review of the public and private tree ordinances alongside efforts by community groups to identify landmark trees. The council also coordinated tree care strategies and discussed community maintenance support during severe regional drought conditions.",
